                     <entry class="- topic/entry " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/appendices/performance.dita" xtrc="entry:39;130:29">Running flag 1 if running 0 if not running When the motor is rotating at a very low speed, less than 25% of its rated speed (rated RPM), the analytics may interpret the motor as stopped. <codeblock xml:space="preserve" class="+ topic/pre pr-d/codeblock " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/appendices/performance.dita" xtrc="codeblock:13;130:227">running is used to calculate the Number of Starts in a time range.
  Chronologically sort the performance records in the time range and count the number of times _running_ transitions from '0' to '1'. This approximates the number of times the motor started in the specified time range.</codeblock>
